            "reviewBody": "Yummy dressing and at a fraction of the cost of the bottled stuff. So easy to make! Thanks for the great recipe, paralee!! \n\nI substituted Splenda for the sugar (two diabetics in the house)and rice vinegar for the wine vinegar and served it with a spinach and strawberry salad.",
